    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "CHAPTER 5 · CODE LUB"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Lubricating Oil"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "One oil, a dozen names. Grade, base stock and application are what make two oils interchangeable - brand names are not part of this guide and never go in a field."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Write the category as: Lubricating Oil  You may receive: Oil; Lube Oil; Lubricant; Turbine Oil; Hydraulic Oil; Gear Oil; Compressor Oil"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Fields at a glance"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "",
      "columns": [
        "Rule",
        "Field key",
        "Labels you may see",
        "What to write"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "LUB-1": "viscosity_grade",
          "Viscosity; Grade; Viscosity Grade; VG": "ISO VG {n} | SAE {grade}"
        },
        {
          "LUB-2": "base_oil",
          "Base Oil; Base Stock; Base": "Picklist value"
        },
        {
          "LUB-3": "application",
          "Application; Use; Service": "Picklist value"
        },
        {
          "LUB-4": "iso_class",
          "ISO Class; ISO 6743; Classification": "ISO 6743 family letters"
        },
        {
          "LUB-5": "pack_size",
          "Pack; Pack Size; Packaging; Container": "{n} L"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Rule cards"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LUB-1 viscosity_grade\nIF value is VG46, ISO 46, ISO VG46 or 46 cSt THEN ISO VG 46 (valid ISO grades: 10 15 22 32 46 68 100 150 220 320 460 680)\nIF value is a multigrade like 15W40 THEN SAE 15W-40 (hyphen before the hot grade)\nIF value is SAE 90, SAE 140 THEN keep SAE {n}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LUB-2 base_oil\nIF value IN (mineral; Group I; Group II) THEN write \"Mineral\"\nIF value IN (Group III; hydrocracked) THEN write \"Group III\"\nIF value IN (synthetic hydrocarbon; polyalphaolefin; PAO) THEN write \"PAO\"\nIF value IN (ester; synthetic ester) THEN write \"Ester\"\nIF value IN (polyglycol; polyalkylene glycol; PAG) THEN write \"PAG\"\nWatch out! 'Semi-synthetic' and 'synthetic blend' don't tell you the base - write CHECK: and let the lubrication engineer decide."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sample field guide for testing data standardization. Keep it on your desk, not in a drawer."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "LUB-3 application"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (R&O turbine; turbine; steam turbine) THEN write \"Turbine\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (AW hydraulic; hydraulic; HM) THEN write \"Hydraulic\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (EP gear; gear; industrial gear) THEN write \"Gear\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (compressor; screw compressor) THEN write \"Compressor\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (gas engine) THEN write \"Gas Engine\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (diesel; HDDO; engine oil) THEN write \"Diesel Engine\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (circulating; paper machine) THEN write \"Circulating\""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "LUB-4 iso_class"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "REMOVE ISO, L- and the viscosity number: ISO L-HM 46 -> HM"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Allowed: HH HL HM HV HG TSA TGA CKB CKC CKD DAA DAB DAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "LUB-5 pack_size"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (drum; 55 gal drum; 205 L drum; 45 imp gal drum) THEN write \"208 L\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (5 gal pail) THEN write \"18.9 L\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF value IN (IBC; tote) THEN write \"1000 L\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Standard packs first (table above), otherwise convert gallons x 3.785, quarts x 0.946"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Before → after"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "",
      "columns": [
        "BEFORE",
        "AFTER"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "Viscosity: VG46": "viscosity_grade: ISO VG 46"
        },
        {
          "Grade: ISO 32": "viscosity_grade: ISO VG 32"
        },
        {
          "Viscosity Grade: 15W40": "viscosity_grade: SAE 15W-40"
        },
