        },
        {
          "Packaging: IBC": "pack_size: 1000 L"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Grease"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Greases are defined by consistency (NLGI), thickener and base oil viscosity. Get those three right and you can find a substitute in any warehouse."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Write the category as: Grease  You may receive: Grease; Lubricating Grease; EP Grease; Bearing Grease"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Fields at a glance"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "",
      "columns": [
        "Rule",
        "Field key",
        "Labels you may see",
        "What to write"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "GRS-1": "nlgi_grade",
          "NLGI; NLGI Grade; Consistency; Grade": "NLGI {n}"
        },
        {
          "GRS-2": "thickener",
          "Thickener; Soap; Soap Type": "Picklist value"
        },
        {
          "GRS-3": "base_oil_viscosity",
          "Base Oil Viscosity; Base Viscosity; Oil Viscosity": "{n} cSt @ 40 °C"
        },
        {
          "GRS-4": "ep_additive",
          "EP; Extreme Pressure; EP Additive": "Yes | No"
        },
        {
          "GRS-5": "pack_size",
          "Pack; Pack Size; Packaging": "{n} kg"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Rule cards"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GRS-1 nlgi_grade\nStrip EP, #, grade and spaces, keep the number: EP2 -> NLGI 2; #2 -> NLGI 2\nGrades 000 and 00 keep their zeros: NLGI 00"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GRS-2 thickener\nIF value IN (lithium; Li; lithium soap) THEN write \"Lithium\"\nIF value IN (Li complex; Li-X; LiX; lithium complex) THEN write \"Lithium Complex\"\nIF value IN (Ca sulphonate; calcium sulfonate; CaS) THEN write \"Calcium Sulfonate\"\nIF value IN (polyurea; PU thickener) THEN write \"Polyurea\"\nIF value IN (Al complex; aluminum complex) THEN write \"Aluminium Complex\"\nIF value IN (clay; bentonite; organoclay) THEN write \"Bentonite\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GRS-3 base_oil_viscosity\nIF ISO VG n base THEN n cSt @ 40 °C\nmm2/s and mm2/s equal cSt"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GRS-4 ep_additive\nIF value is EP or contains EP THEN Yes; IF non-EP THEN No"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GRS-5 pack_size\nGrease is sold by weight: g / 1000, lb x 0.4536, oz x 0.02835; one decimal"
    }
  ]
}

