    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "CHAPTER 7 · CODE FLT"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Filter Element"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A filter element is described by what it filters, how fine, on which basis, and with what media. Part numbers are useful but they live in the purchasing record, not here."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Write the category as: Filter Element  You may receive: Filter; Filter Element; Filter Cartridge; Cartridge; Element"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Fields at a glance"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "",
      "columns": [
        "Rule",
        "Field key",
        "Labels you may see",
        "What to write"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "FLT-1": "filter_service",
          "Service; Application; Filter Type": "Picklist value"
        },
        {
          "FLT-2": "micron_rating",
          "Micron; Micron Rating; Rating; Filtration Rating": "{n} µm"
        },
        {
          "FLT-3": "rating_basis",
          "Beta; Rating Basis; Efficiency": "Absolute | Nominal"
        },
        {
          "FLT-4": "media",
          "Media; Filter Media; Element Material": "Picklist value"
        },
        {
          "FLT-5": "collapse_pressure",
          "Collapse; Collapse Pressure; Burst; Differential Rating": "{n} bar"
        },
        {
          "FLT-6": "seal_material",
          "Seals; Seal Material; Gasket": "Picklist value (same as O-Ring material)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Rule cards"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FLT-1 filter_service\nIF value IN (hydraulic; HYD) THEN write \"Hydraulic\"\nIF value IN (LO; lube; lube oil) THEN write \"Lube Oil\"\nIF value IN (fuel; diesel fuel) THEN write \"Fuel\"\nIF value IN (inlet air; air intake; intake) THEN write \"Air Intake\"\nIF value IN (coalescing; coalescer) THEN write \"Coalescer\"\nIF value IN (gas; fuel gas) THEN write \"Gas\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FLT-2 micron_rating\nmicron, microns, u, um, µ all become µm"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FLT-3 rating_basis\nIF value IN (abs; absolute; beta 200; beta 1000; B10>=200) THEN write \"Absolute\"\nIF value IN (nom; nominal) THEN write \"Nominal\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Sample field guide for testing data standardization. Keep it on your desk, not in a drawer."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FG-07 · The Spares Cataloguer's Field Guide"
    },
    {
