    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GLV-1 glove_size\nIF value IN (S; small) THEN write \"7\"\nIF value IN (M; medium) THEN write \"8\"\nIF value IN (L; large) THEN write \"9\"\nIF value IN (XL) THEN write \"10\"\nIF value IN (XXL; 2XL) THEN write \"11\"\nIF value is 'size n' THEN n"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GLV-2 cut_level\nIF value is an EN 388 code like 4X43D THEN the 5th character is the cut level: Cut D\nIF value is 'ISO cut C' or 'cut C' THEN Cut C\nIF value is an old numeric level (level 5) or an ANSI level (A4) THEN CHECK: (no reliable conversion)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GLV-3 glove_material\nIF value IN (nitrile) THEN write \"Nitrile\"\nIF value IN (latex; natural rubber) THEN write \"Latex\"\nIF value IN (neoprene; chloroprene) THEN write \"Neoprene\"\nIF value IN (leather; cowhide; goatskin) THEN write \"Leather\"\nIF value IN (Dyneema; HPPE; UHMWPE) THEN write \"HPPE\"\nIF value IN (Kevlar; aramid; para-aramid) THEN write \"Aramid\"\nIF value IN (PVC) THEN write \"PVC\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GLV-4 coating\nIF value IN (sandy nitrile; nitrile palm; foam nitrile) THEN write \"Nitrile Palm\"\nIF value IN (PU coated palm; polyurethane palm) THEN write \"PU Palm\"\nIF value IN (crinkle latex) THEN write \"Latex Crinkle\"\nIF value IN (uncoated; none) THEN write \"None\""
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GLV-5 cuff_length\ninch x 25.4, round to whole mm"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GLV-6 impact_protection\nIF TPR back, impact, EN 388 'P' marking THEN Yes"
    },
